        <briefdescription>
<para>Check if <computeroutput>Root</computeroutput> follows a pattern Root(ext(LHS), ext(RHS)) where <computeroutput>ext</computeroutput> is the same for both LHS and RHS (i.e., both are sext or both are zext) and LHS and RHS can be folded into Root. </para>
