        <detaileddescription>
<para>AllowExtMask define which form <computeroutput>ext</computeroutput> can take in this pattern.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>If the pattern can match with both zext and sext, the returned <ref refid="structanonymous__namespace_02_r_i_s_c_v_i_sel_lowering_8cpp_03_1_1_combine_result" kindref="compound">CombineResult</ref> will feature the zext result.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>std::nullopt if the pattern doesn&apos;t match or a <ref refid="structanonymous__namespace_02_r_i_s_c_v_i_sel_lowering_8cpp_03_1_1_combine_result" kindref="compound">CombineResult</ref> that can be used to apply the pattern. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
